  "description": "Capable of a max power output of 200W, powered by two 18650 batteries (sold separately), the GeekVape Aegis Legend 2 Mod is a sub-ohm powerhouse, designed to produce incredible clouds and immaculate flavour from your favourite tank and e-liquid. The new Legend 2 is 30% lighter than its predecessor, but still bears all the Aegis hallmarks of durability, quality and comfortable ergonomics. Thanks to GeekVape’s Tri-proof technology, the Legend 2 mod is dustproof, waterproof and shockproof. It can even operate between -20c to 50c. It also fits beautifully in the hand thanks to high-grade industrial materials and grippy leather and rubber trim. The mod offers unparalleled customisation for vape enthusiasts, with multiple modes including variable wattage mode, variable power curve mode, temperature control mode and bypass mode. The advanced chipset incorporates a host of safety protections as well as intelligent coil recognition, while a new larger 1.03” screen on the front allows you to view and change your settings to suit your preferred vaping style. Type-C USB charging gets the device up to charge quicker than ever. The new A-Lock feature on Legend 2 makes it safer to carry. Simply swipe it down and lock it up. This lock protects you from burning out your coil accidentally. The mod naturally pairs best with GeekVape’s new Z 2021 Vape Tank, but its 810 connector makes it compatible with most similar tanks. NB: Batteries must be purchased separately - this setup requires 2 x 18650",
